WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.219
Advertising is four rights:

00:00:02.269 --> 00:00:03.221
the right message,

00:00:03.271 --> 00:00:04.283
to the right person,

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:05.250
in the right place,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.874
at the right time.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:08.367
At three in the afternoon,

00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:10.878
the fast food screen shows snacks,

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:12.933
and a passing tradie stops.

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:14.467
By six,

00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:16.142
it switches to family meals,

00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:18.687
and a mum with her kids heads straight in.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.621
Behind every ad sit four steps: strategy, idea, make it, place it.

00:00:24.671 --> 00:00:29.222
And always go where the eyeballs are, which today means the phone.
